  "description": "Experience the ultimate adventure with the Kingbull Hunter 2.0S, a high-performance electric mountain bike designed to conquer the most challenging terrains with ease. This powerful off-road e-bike features rugged 26\" x 4\" fat tires for superior traction and stability in sand, snow and mud, while its upgraded 750W motor and responsive hydraulic brakes ensure a safe, exciting ride. Offering an extra-long 80 miles of range, the Hunter 2.0S is the most durable and versatile choice for riders looking for a premium all-terrain experience, whether you're exploring deep backcountry trails or commuting in the backcountry.\nFor optimal performance and safety, we recommend maintaining tire pressure within the range of 25–28 PSI, which helps improve comfort, traction, and overall riding stability across different terrains.",
